    "recommendation": "**NEEDS HUMAN REVIEW AND VERIFICATION** \u2014 B&P \u00a717501 permits a former-price comparison only where the reference price was the prevailing market price within three months of the advertisement, or where the date the reference price prevailed is disclosed. On a used vehicle there is no MSRP, so \"List Price $35,995\" is the dealer's own asking price and the $3,410 \"Dealer Discount\" is a savings claim measured against it. The same construction appears on the 2024 X3 VDP (\"List Price $32,995 / Dealer Discount -$3,710 / Selling Price $29,370\"). Retain dated pricing history proving each List Price was actually offered, or add the date the reference price prevailed next to the discount line.",
